### (4) Exact Commands to Start Both Products

#### Product A — Reelsmax

Start server only:
```bash
cd ~/HydrocarbonForge/Projects/reelsmax
python3 server.py
# Or with explicit port:
PORT=8905 python3 server.py
```

Start server + Chromium Wall mode on DISPLAY=:0:
```bash
cd ~/HydrocarbonForge/Projects/reelsmax
./run.sh --browser
```

Launch multi-window mode:
```bash
cd ~/HydrocarbonForge/Projects/reelsmax
python3 window_mode.py 6
```

Re-run automated verification test suites:
```bash
cd ~/HydrocarbonForge/Projects/reelsmax
python3 verify_product_a.py
python3 verify_dom_fit.py
```

#### Product B — Forge Console

Standalone test mode (leaves running production service untouched):
```bash
cd ~/HydrocarbonForge/Projects/forge-console
PORT=8910 python3 server.py
```

Re-run automated Product B verification suite:
```bash
cd ~/HydrocarbonForge/Projects/forge-console
python3 verify_product_b.py
```

Activate in production (to be performed by C6):
```bash
systemctl --user restart forge-console.service
```

